{"text": "In front of the castle, little trees stood around a small mirror. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The mirror looked like a lake, and wax swans were swimming on it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the open door of the castle stood a pretty little lady. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was a dancer, and she was cut out of paper too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She wore a dress of thin cloth and a narrow blue ribbon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the middle was a shiny spangle as big as her face. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was holding out both arms, because she was dancing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was kicking one leg up so high that he could not see it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She has only one leg, just like me, thought the soldier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But she lives in a castle, and I only have a box. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He lay down behind a snuffbox on the table to watch her.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "f", "r", "o", "n", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "a", "s", "t", "l", "e", ",", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", "s", " ", "s", "t", "o", "o", "d", " ", "a", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "a", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "m", "i", "r", "r", "o", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "m", "i", "r", "r", "o", "r", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "l", "a", "k", "e", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "a", "x", " ", "s", "w", "a", "n", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "s", "w", "i", "m", "m", "i", "n", "g", " ", "o", "n", " ", "i", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "a", "s", "t", "l", "e", " ", "s", "t", "o", "o", "d", " ", "a", " ", "p", 